    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d825">

                <pb facs="0909" n="1743" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1743"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 652.119/1469</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The War Trade Board Representative in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-08-22T16:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 22, 1918, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 7.45 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>For Stabler. Your August 21. Spanish Minister advises me that he sent a telegram
                    for the Transatlantic Company some days ago <pb facs="0910" n="1744"
                        xml:id="pg1744"/> regarding the matter discussed in your office and expects
                    a reply from day to day. See my letters of August 10 and 14 upon this
                    subject.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
